# remote FRAS Map
remote/attach.go [Edge]: F:Single SSH connection handler and daemon version lifecycle manager | S:见 Security invariants 第 5 条
remote/daemon.go [Core]: F:Host-side detached background daemon and socket listener | S:见 Security invariants 第 5 条
remote/frame.go [Infra]: F:Frame serialization and deserialization for host-gateway protocol | A:Header [T:TestFrameRoundTrip]
