remote/link.go [Core]: F:Sequenced reliable link mirroring TypeScript ReliableLink | A:Link [T:TestLinkResendsOnlyWhatThePeerMissed]
remote/main.go [Edge]: F:CLI entrypoint dispatching attach, daemon, shim, and dumpenv
remote/ops.go [Core]: F:Host filesystem and command operations | A:handleOp
remote/paths.go [Infra]: F:Host directory layout and path helpers
remote/proc.go [Core]: F:Host agent process manager with Pdeathsig process lifecycle | A:ProcManager
remote/relay.go [Core]: F:Loopback HTTP forwarder relay for agent API calls | A:Relay [T:TestRelayForwardsAndStreams]
remote/shellenv.go [Infra]: F:Login shell environment capture and cache
remote/shim.go [Edge]: F:Host reverse CLI shim proxying commands to gateway
